{
  "name": "fly-macaroon",
  "description": "A production-grade implementation of Macaroon tokens used for distributed authorization and fine-grained access control within the Fly.io platform. The system employs cryptographically chained caveats to enable decentralized token attenuation, supporting both first-party and third-party discharge flows via symmetric-key cryptography. It features a robust resource matching engine and MessagePack-based serialization for high-performance credential validation in high-scale network environments.",
